<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>JMJ Clean | Residential Cleaning in Orlando</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Professional residential cleaning services in Orlando and surrounding areas. Reliable, trusted and affordable.">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <img src="logo.svg" alt="JMJ Clean Logo" class="logo">
  <h1>Residential Cleaning Services in Orlando & Surrounding Areas</h1>
  <p>Reliable • Trusted • Affordable</p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="#contact" class="btn primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn secondary">Schedule Cleaning</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <ul class="services">
    <li>Regular House Cleaning</li>
    <li>Deep Cleaning</li>
    <li>Move-In / Move-Out Cleaning</li>
    <li>Apartments & Condos</li>
    <li>Airbnb & Vacation Homes</li>
    <li>One-Time Cleaning</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section light">
  <h2>Why Choose JMJ Clean?</h2>
  <p>
    We are a professional residential cleaning company proudly serving Orlando and Central Florida.
    Our team is trained, trustworthy, and committed to delivering spotless results every time.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Service Area</h2>
  <p>Orlando • Kissimmee • Winter Park • Lake Nona • Altamonte Springs</p>
</section>

<section class="section light" id="contact">
  <h2>Get Your Free Estimate</h2>
  <form class="contact-form">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Full Name" required>
    <input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
    <input type="text" placeholder="Phone Number">
    <textarea placeholder="Message"></textarea>
    <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Request a Quote</button>
  </form>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 JMJ Clean – Residential Cleaning Services</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
